    "heroSubtitle": "Kathak classes for kids and adults, online and at the Kendra.",
    "aboutText": "Sangeet Manjari Kala Kendra is a home for Kathak, the storytelling dance of North India. We teach in the guru–shishya way – footwork, spins, gestures and expression, with the music and taal behind them – so every student dances with confidence and understanding.",
