  "guru": {
    "name": "Akshita Sharma",
    "title": "Founder & Kathak Guru · Kathak Artist & Vocalist",
    "photo": "7838",
    "bio": "Akshita Sharma is a Kathak artist and vocalist from Jaipur with about nine years of training in Kathak, alongside Hindustani classical vocal music and tabla. She founded Sangeet Manjari Kala Kendra to teach Kathak in a structured, traditional way – building both practical skill and theoretical understanding – and prepares students for grade examinations. She has a deep interest in Indian cultural heritage, temple art and architecture, and how music and dance have evolved over time.",
